  "schema_version": "0.2.0",
  "based_on": "BEP037 NIBS-BIDS, draft v6.2 (2026-03). Field keys are a grounded reconstruction from the NIBS/TMS reporting domain and the BEP037 structure (TMS/tES/TUS; parameters harmonised with SimNIBS where possible). The authoritative spec is the locked BEP037 Google document; reconcile key names against it and bump schema_version when you do.",
